{ ================================================================================
  S3 - RAPID PULLBACK SHORT STRATEGY  (v2.0)
  Signal Name : S3_RapidPullbackShort_v2
  MC Load Name: STRATEGY_GEN_S3_RapidPullbackShort_v2
  Version     : v2.0.4 (2026-06-20) - USER-MANDATED defaults LOCKED to 17-trade MC opt
  Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
  Platform    : MultiCharts 12 PowerLanguage x64
  Timeframe   : Data1 = 5M    (entry trigger / exit chain)
                Data2 = 60M   (regime gate: MA20/MA60/RSI14/dist%)
                            [*] v2.0: previously reserved in v1.1, now ACTIVE
                Data3 = Daily (Secular Bull Filter MA60/MA200)
                            [*] v2.0.3: re-added Daily (was removed in v2.0,
                              re-introduced for Secular Bull Filter on
                              standard 60/200 day MA - shorter Max Bars
                              requirement than 60M MA3800 alternative)
  Class       : Counter-trend short with momentum confirmation
                (sells overheated bull pullbacks intraday)
                SAME thesis as v1.1 - only regime time-frame changed.

  ============================================================
  v2.0 CHANGE LOG vs v1.1 (USER OPTION B, 2026-06-20)
  ============================================================
  Thesis: UNCHANGED - "Counter-trend short during overheated bull
                       regime pullbacks"
  Root cause of v1.1 underperformance: Daily Tier 1 too restrictive
    -> only 9 trades/yr (target 25-40), PF after slippage -0.92.
  Fix path: Shorten regime time-frame Daily -> 60M (one tier shorter).
    Same A AND (B OR C) structure, recalibrated thresholds.

  CHANGES:
    [REGIME] Data3 Daily -> Data2 60M
             Daily_FastMA_Len 20 -> H60_FastMA_Len 20  (~20 hours ~= 1 trading day)
             Daily_SlowMA_Len 60 -> H60_SlowMA_Len 60  (~60 hours ~= 3 trading days)
             Daily_RSI_Threshold 70 -> H60_RSI_Threshold 65 (shorter TF, RSI noisier)
             Daily_RSI_Sustained_Bars 2 -> H60_RSI_Sustained_Bars 2
                                            (still 2, but each bar = 1hr not 1day)
             Daily_Dist_MA20_Pct 3.0 -> H60_Dist_MA20_Pct 1.5
                                        (60M dist is intrinsically smaller)
    [RSI_SNAP] Removed Daily snapshot trick (Snap0..Snap3).
               60M K updates hourly; v_H60_RSI_Snap0..Snap3 tracks
               last 4 closed 60M bars' RSI via Data2-bar-boundary
               detection. (Same anti-stale principle, faster cadence.)
               [*] v2.0.1 MC12 PATCH: boundary detection changed from
                 Hour(Time) (assumed 60M align hour, FALSE for TXF1
                 session-aligned 60M) to ( Date of Data2, Time of Data2 )
                 tuple. Snap0 reads ( RSI(...) of Data2 )[1] = previous
                 just-CLOSED 60M bar (not partial current). See Section 4.
    [EXIT]   TP_Pct       0.7 -> 0.6
             SL_ATR_Mult  4   -> 3
             Max_Bars_TimeStop 24 -> 18   (24 * 5M = 120min -> 18 * 5M = 90min)
    [ENTRY]  Entry_Cutoff_Time 1230 -> 1325  (wider day window)
    [MOMENTUM] 5M Tier 2 (M1-M4) preserved identically.
               Default Pullback_Min_Pct 0.5 -> 0.3 (allow tighter entries)
    [SESSION] Day-only operation preserved. Night session deferred to v2.1
              (v2.0 LOCKED decision #2 dual-session split into staged delivery).
    [STRUCT] 100% preserved from v1.1:
             - Holiday tail registry (63 entries)
             - Settlement_Flat module (Rule #11)
             - SetStopLoss + Frozen SL backup (Rule #12)
             - Daily force flat 13:25 / cooldown / kill switch
             - Closed-interval time audit

  EXPECTED PERFORMANCE (pre-backtest):
             Trades/yr   v1.1:  9      ->  v2.0: 25-50 (target)
             PF gross    v1.1:  1.37   ->  v2.0: 1.25-1.45
             PF net      v1.1: -0.92   ->  v2.0: 1.05-1.25
             WR          v1.1:  53.8%  ->  v2.0: 48-55%
             Sample concentration: less 2026 H1 over-fit expected

  ============================================================
  CONSTITUTION COMPLIANCE (CLAUDE.md):
    Rule #11 Settlement_Flat (7 elements): present in Priority 0.
    Rule #12 P3b SetStopLoss: single call before entry block,
             guarded by MarketPosition >= 0 (short variant).
    Rule #13 10-dim eval before live_simulation: deferred to
             post-backtest gate.

  LABEL CONVENTIONS:
    SE_RPS_v2_*  short entry labels
    SX_RPS_v2_*  short exit labels (one per exit reason)

  PERFORMANCE: NO BACKTEST YET. v2.0 is research-tier only.
================================================================================ }

[IntrabarOrderGeneration = false]


{ ============================================================
  SECTION 1 - INPUTS
  All numeric thresholds parameterized for MC12 optimization.
  v2.0 defaults differ from v1.1 where noted.
  See: S3_v2_optimization_ranges.md
  ============================================================ }

inputs:
    { ===== Tier 1 : Regime Gate Parameters (60M, Data2) =====
      v2.0: time-frame shortened from Daily to 60M.
      Same A AND (B OR C) structure; thresholds recalibrated.
      [*] v2.0.4: USER-MANDATED LOCK-IN from 17-trade MC opt (2026-06-20). }
    H60_FastMA_Len            ( 20    ),   { opt 10..30 step 5  ; ~20hr trend }
    H60_SlowMA_Len            ( 60    ),   { opt 40..120 step 10; ~60hr trend }
    H60_RSI_Len               ( 14    ),   { opt 7..21 step 7   ; 14hr RSI }
    H60_RSI_Threshold         ( 70    ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 70 (was 65); opt 55..75 step 5 }
    H60_RSI_Sustained_Bars    ( 2     ),   { opt 1..4 step 1    ; bars=hours }
    H60_Dist_MA20_Pct         ( 1.5   ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 1.5; opt 1.0..3.0 step 0.5 }

    { ===== Tier 2 : Momentum Trigger Parameters (5M, Data1) =====
      Preserved identically from v1.1 - momentum micro-structure
      is regime-independent.
      [*] v2.0.4: USER-MANDATED LOCK-IN from 17-trade MC opt. }
    Consec_Red_Bars           ( 3     ),   { LOCKED 3; opt 2..5 step 1 }
    EMA_Fast_Len              ( 5     ),   { opt 5..10 step 1 }
    ATR_Short_Len             ( 5     ),   { opt 3..7 step 1 }
    ATR_Long_Len              ( 20    ),   { opt 15..30 step 5 }
    ATR_Spike_Mult            ( 1.0   ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 1.0 (was 1.3); opt 1.0..1.6 step 0.1 }
    Pullback_Min_Pct          ( 0.5   ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 0.5 (was 0.3); opt 0.2..0.6 step 0.1 }
    Pullback_Max_Pct          ( 1.5   ),   { LOCKED 1.5; opt 1.0..2.0 step 0.25 }

    { ===== Exit Parameters - v2.0.4 USER-MANDATED LOCK-IN ===== }
    TP_Pct                    ( 1.0   ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 1.0 (was 0.6); opt 0.5..1.2 step 0.1 }
    TP_Use_EMA20_Backup       ( True  ),   { D4 structural backup preserved }
    TP_MA_Len                 ( 20    ),   { opt 15..30 step 5 }
    TP_EMA20_MinBars          ( 3     ),   { opt 2..6 step 1 }
    SL_ATR_Len                ( 14    ),   { opt 10..21 step 1 }
    SL_ATR_Mult               ( 2.5   ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 2.5 (was 3); winning value vs SL=1.5/2.0/3 backtests }
    Max_Bars_TimeStop         ( 27    ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 27 = 135min hold (was 18); allows winners to develop }
    Entry_Open_Time           ( 850   ),   { D5: first eligible 5M bar (08:50 close) }
    Entry_Cutoff_Time         ( 1230  ),   { v2.0.4 LOCKED 1230 (was 1325); per 11:xx WR=20% empirical }
    Daily_Flat_Time           ( 1325  ),   { force flat by 13:25 }

    { ===== Priority 0 Protection (Rule #11 / #12) - unchanged from v1.1 ===== }
    Holiday_Flat_Time         ( 245   ),   { 02:45 holiday tail flat retry start }
    Registry_Valid_Until      ( 1270101 ), { TAIFEX-verified horizon }
    Manual_Kill_Switch        ( False ),
    Settlement_Flat_Time      ( 1230  ),   { 1hr buffer before 13:30 settlement }

    { ===== Secular Bull Filter (v2.0.3 REVISED, Section 2b) =====
      Mirror of L1 P6 Weekly filter, applied at Daily level (Data3).
      3 conditions AND: Close > MA_Fast AND Close > MA_Slow AND MA_Fast > MA_Slow.
      Prevents counter-trend short entries during bear regime OR weak-rally periods.
      Default ON; can disable via input.
      v2.0.3  Daily Data3 ( v2.0.2  60M MA1140/MA3800):
        - Max Bars  5000  300 (Daily MA200 + buffer)
        - Input  60/200 day MA
        - Warmup  ~200 day (), chart load  }
    Enable_Secular_Bull_Filter ( True ),   { v2.0.3: default ON }
    Daily_SecularMA_Fast       ( 60   ),   { Daily MA60 () }
    Daily_SecularMA_Slow       ( 200  ),   { Daily MA200 () }

    { ===== Diagnostic (logging-only) ===== }
    Log_HighConviction        ( True  ),
    HighConv_Threshold_Pct    ( 5.0   ); { v2.0.4 LOCKED 5.0 (was 2.5); aligned with backtest setting; log-only, no trade impact }


