      Snap0 = most recent CLOSED 60M RSI (from [1] of Data2 = previous bar)
      Snap1 = 1 bar ago; Snap2 = 2 bars ago; Snap3 = 3 bars ago.
      Shifts in Section 4 when Data2 advances to a new bar. }
    v_H60_RSI_Snap0          ( 0     ),
